1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:01,740
After that came Kinshasa.

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:03,960
Why did Dufraisne take you with him?

3
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:05,570
Security.

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,530
Dufraisne was closing
the Red Mercury deal,

5
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,540
but he wasn't sure about his new allies.

6
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:13,360
He kept me out of sight
to step in if things went sour.

7
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,570
That was when all
of Lambert's planning paid off.

8
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:21,240
I was on site and left alone, so I could
listen in on Dufraisne's meeting.

9
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:23,780
We finally learned what he was planning.
